# Team Instructions

## Working Rules

- Keep diffs reviewable.
- Add focused tests for behavior changes.
- Prefer deterministic checks over repeated reminders.
- Route customer-facing or high-blast-radius work to human review.

## Verification

```bash
npm run lint
npm test
npm run e2e
```

## Local Context

- Put only rules that apply to most work in this directory here.
- Move reusable procedures to skills.
- Move human background material to docs.
